  "journal": {
    "s12_journal": {
      "title": "The Sixfold Council",
      "text": "Valebridge is the biggest city I've ever walked through. We left the dossier at the royal archive and were summoned straight to Queen Aveline, who heard us out and opened Eldervale's sealed records. They say the six kingdoms were made keepers of something older than any of them: the city itself stands on the foundations of earlier builders, and the Old Vault kept one carved stone and sent five more to five other keepers. The Queen gave us the vault stone, Liora gave us her rubbing of the grove stone, and Thane Garrick of Stonecrown has found a carved mechanism beneath Irondeep. That's where we go next."
    }
  }
